 color: var(--sclad-primary, #111); font-family: var(--sclad-heading, Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif); } #about-c1 .sclad-about-portrait-copy p { color: var(--sclad-muted, #555049); } #about-c1 .sclad-about-portrait-link { color: var(--sclad-primary, #111); border-bottom-color: var(--sclad-primary, #111); }</style><section id=\"about-c1\" class=\"sclad-r sclad-r-pad sclad-about-portrait\"> <div class=\"sclad-stack sclad-about-portrait-inner\"> <div class=\"sclad-about-portrait-media\"> <img src=\"https://placehold.co/480x600?text=Our+School\" alt=\"Students on the school grounds\"> </div> <div class=\"sclad-about-portrait-copy\"> <p class=\"sclad-about-portrait-label\">Our Story</p> <h2>A school built on character and curiosity</h2> <p>We hold a high standard and a warm welcome in the same hand. Lessons stay personal, teachers stay close, and every learner is known by name.</p> <p>From the first classroom to the final year, we raise students who can think clearly, speak honestly, and care for the people beside them.</p> <a href=\"#\" data-sclad-apply class=\"sclad-about-portrait-link\">Read our story</a> </div> </div> </section>"
