y of teachers and families who believe a good school is both demanding and kind.</p> <div class=\"sclad-grid sclad-about-mast-cols\"> <div> <p>Classes stay small enough for a teacher to notice the student who is ready to go further, and the one who needs another explanation.</p> <p>We teach the subjects carefully, and we also teach attention, courtesy, and the habit of finishing what was begun.</p> </div> <div> <p>Arts, sport, and practical work sit beside the academic day, so talent is not narrowed to a single kind of success.</p> <p>Parents are partners here. Progress is visible, messages are plain, and every child is greeted by name.</p> </div> </div> <div class=\"sclad-about-mast-media\"> <img src=\"https://placehold.co/1100x480?text=School+Life\" alt=\"A day in the life of the school\"> <p class=\"sclad-about-mast-cap\">School life, every day</p> </div> </div> </section>"
