> <p class=\"sclad-about-chronicle-year\">Growth</p> <h3>Rooms, fields, and new subjects</h3> <p>Classrooms, a library, laboratories, and sport were added while class sizes stayed honest.</p> </li> <li> <p class=\"sclad-about-chronicle-year\">Today</p> <h3>The same standard, kept current</h3> <p>We still improve the campus and the timetable, and we still know our students by name.</p> </li> </ul> </div> </section>"
